SAFETY NOTICE

This application displays navigation and notification information on a motorcycle
instrument cluster. It is an aid, not a substitute for the rider's attention to
the road, to the vehicle's own instruments, or to applicable traffic law. The
rider is solely responsible for safe operation of the vehicle. Do not interact
with the handset while riding.
